    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from Chancellor's Chambers is a puzzle game with platforming elements where you play as a Wizard trying to escape from the many chambers below the chancellor's castle. <br> <br>Solve puzzles, avoid traps, and find spells to help aid you in your escape. You may meet some interesting characters along the way!<br><br><br>There are several spells that can help the player progress past challenges that were previously impossible.<br><br>There is an in-depth story that will try to pull in the player and teach them about the world and the characters inside it, including what roles they play.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from Chancellor's Chambers is a puzzle game with platforming elements where you play as a Wizard trying to escape from the many chambers below the chancellor's castle. <br> <br>Solve puzzles, avoid traps, and find spells to help aid you in your escape. You may meet some interesting characters along the way!<br><br><br>There are several spells that can help the player progress past challenges that were previously impossible.<br><br>There is an in-depth story that will try to pull in the player and teach them about the world and the characters inside it, including what roles they play.</p>",
    "short_description": "A magical escape room experience that tests your skill with magic spells and puzzle solving! Do you have what it takes to get out of the Chancellor's Chambers?",
